---
layout: base
as: raw
md: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
eleventyImport:
  collections: ["example"]
---

Imagine this a an RSS feed,
looping over articles…

<article webc:for="item of collections.example">
  <hr>
  <h2 @html="item.data.title"></h2>
  <div
    webc:nokeep
    webc:if="item.data.md"
    @raw="item.content"
  ></div>
  <div
    webc:nokeep
    webc:else
    @html="item.content"
  ></div>
</article>

---


The original issue is the same
if we use `@raw` or `@html` in the layout --
But the fix requires `raw` output.
